          "text": " Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aana burume buno khu Mika owaama mu lukoba lwa Moresiesi, mu ndaalo nicho Yosamu, Ahasi, ne Hesekia bamiilamo Yuda. Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ekesia Mika kamakhuwa kano koosi khuloondekhana ne Samaria ne Yerusalemu.",
